OL,3,ATrump to host Xi for White House talks
OL,4,Awith AI, trade and Iran among key
OL,5,Aissues
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump is due to host Xi Jinping
OL,8,Fat the White House as part of the
OL,9,FChinese leader's historic three-day
OL,10,Fvisit to the US - here's what we've
OL,11,Fseen so far
OL,13,FXi will get a formal welcome on the
OL,14,FWhite House lawn, a military flyover,
OL,15,FOval Office talks and finally a grand
OL,16,Fstate banquet
OL,18,FTariffs, AI, the Iran war and Taiwan
OL,19,Fare among key issues, but major areas
OL,20,Fof disagreement likely won't be bridged
OL,21,Fat the pomp-filled talks, writes the
OL,22,FBBC's Daniel Bush
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
