OL,3,ATrump to host Xi for White House talks
OL,4,Awith AI, trade and Iran among key
OL,5,Aissues
OL,6,
OL,7,FTech bosses and AI executives will join
OL,8,FTrump and Xi at the lavish state dinner
OL,9,Flate on Thursday
OL,11,FXi was greeted by Trump with a rare
OL,12,Fairfield welcome at Joint Base Andrews
OL,13,Fon Wednesday - watch the red carpet
OL,14,Fbeing rolled out
OL,16,FIt came as US Treasury Secretary Scott
OL,17,FBessent said the US and China would
OL,18,Fextend their expiring trade truce to
OL,19,FJanuary
